/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Unless otherwise noted, meetings are held from 10:00 AM to 12:00 PM in Room 538 of the Cross State Office Building in Augusta. The committee generally meets the fourth Thursday of each month.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-3 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Membership</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Edmond Morin, <em>Chair</em></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Wendy Ault</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Paulette Bonneau</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"2026-meetings\">\r\n<h2>2026 Meetings</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width:30%\">Date</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align:center; width:35%\">Agenda</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align:center; width:35%\">Minutes</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>September 24, 2026</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/State%20Board%20-%20CTE%20Meeting%20Agenda%20-%209.24.2026.pdf\">Agenda</a></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>June 25, 2026</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/State%20Board%20-%20CTE%20Meeting%20Agenda%20-%206.25.2026.pdf\">Agenda</a></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>May 28, 2026</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td class=\"doe-action\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/State%20Board%20-%20Career%20and%20Technical%20