e. 24.7× — 1435 characters beside 58. Only the column widths change.","value":"1 row"},{"id":"roster","on":true,"label":"Say what it is before who is on it","why":"This page opens with a narrow card listing the members, and only to the right of it says what the committee does and when it meets. A roster answers a question the reader does not have yet — and because columns stack in source order, on a phone the names are the whole first screen. The two columns swap; no words move and neither column changes width.","value":"1 row"},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"The Career &amp; Technical Education Committee of the Maine State Board of Education is charged with overseeing the Board's administration of federal funds awarded to Maine under the Carl D. Perkins Vocational and Technical Education Act. The Committee is also involved with the State Plan for Career and Technical Education, which is prepared by the Commissioner of Education and approved by the State Board of Education."},{"id":"capheadings","on":true,"label":"Bring every heading up to h3 or above","why":"1 heading sat at h4 or deeper inside a card, a callout, a contact block or an accordion panel — components the outline walk leaves alone because they label a thing rather than a section. A reader using a screen reader still hears the level, so a fourth-level title inside a page that only goes to three is announced as belonging to a level that does not exist. Each is styled by its class and its position rather than its number, so nothing changes on screen.","value":"1 heading"},{"id":"searchtable","on":true,"label":"Let a long table be searched","why":"1 table runs to fifteen rows or more, so finding one row means reading every row. The theme already loads the search behaviour on every page and switches it on for any table marked this way — 26 tables across the site already are, including the contact directory. It adds a search box, a length menu and a pager, and makes the column headings sortable; ten rows show at a time, which is the library's own default. 1 of them open on the most recent row, because the first column is a date that sorts — the rest are left in the order they were written.","value":"1 table, 1 by date"},{"id":"toc","on":true,"label":"Add a contents list (3 sections)","why":"Built from the section headings already on the page. Below three sections a list is not a route."}],"mechanical":["white-on-white text: 9","empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 16","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 88","paragraph inside a table cell unwrapped: 87","row colours handed back to the striping rule: 9","paragraph unwrapped inside a card header: 1","action links marked: 40","action marks dropped from all-link columns: 9","blockhead heading level normalised to h2: 2"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/about/leadership/stateboard/committees/career","title":"Career & Technical Education Committee","changed":"2026-09-11T18:05:43+00:00","words":310,"bytes":13269,"fixes":["white-on-white text: 9","empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 16","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 88","paragraph inside a table cell unwrapped: 87","row colours handed back to the striping rule: 9","paragraph unwrapped inside a card header: 1","action links marked: 40","action marks dropped from all-link columns: 9","blockhead heading level normalised to h2: 2"],"flags":["inline style= remains"],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":2,"t":"Career &amp; Technical Education Committee","bh":true},{"l":4,"t":"Meeting Information","bh":false},{"l":3,"t":"2026 Meetings","bh":true},{"l":3,"t":"Past Meeting Minutes","bh":true}],"outline":[{"i":1,"issue":"jumps h2 to h4","text":"Meeting Information"}],"components":{"cards":3,"cardHeaders":1,"cardTitles":0,"accordions":3,"tables":4,"dataTables":4,"contactCube":0,"jum